{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52891","headline":"以樱桃赐子朝义及周贽（题拟） · 史思明","name":"以樱桃赐子朝义及周贽（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"樱桃一笼子，半赤一半黄（《太平广记》卷四九五引《芝田录》此句作「半已赤，半已黄」）。\n一半与怀王，一半与周贽。\n（同前）（按：《全唐诗》卷八六九收此诗，首句缺二字，今重录。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"史思明","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52891.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52891","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}